## 5. Domain Model Relationships

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Document {
        +str document_id
        +str filename
        +str file_type
        +str content
        +dict metadata
    }

    class Chunk {
        +str chunk_id
        +str document_id
        +int chunk_index
        +str content
        +int start_char
        +int end_char
        +dict metadata
    }

    class Embedding {
        +str embedding_id
        +str chunk_id
        +str model
        +int dimensions
        +list vector
    }

    class Query {
        +str query_id
        +str question
        +dict filters
    }

    class RetrievalResult {
        +str chunk_id
        +float similarity_score
        +int rank
    }

    class RAGResponse {
        +str answer
        +list citations
        +bool grounded
    }

    Document "1" --> "*" Chunk : produces
    Chunk "1" --> "0..1" Embedding : represented by
    Query "1" --> "*" RetrievalResult : retrieves
    RetrievalResult "*" --> "1" Chunk : references
    Query "1" --> "0..1" RAGResponse : generates
```

